      "text_unit_id": "tu_0001",
      "verbatim_text": "In patients with congenital complete or high-degree AVB, pacing is recommended if one of the following risk factors is present: a. Symptoms b. Pauses >3× the cycle length of the ventricular escape rhythm c. Broad QRS escape rhythm d. Prolonged QT interval e. Complex ventricular ectopy f. Mean daytime heart rate <50 b.p.m."
    },
